  "independence": "members treated as independent; neg-risk/same-event dependence is not modelled",
  "pair": "within one drawn stratum, triggered T and untriggered U screened members give min(T, U) drawn pairs (triggered_per_stratum = per-stratum count, one control per trigger, controls only from the same stratum)",
  "populations": {
